		{
			"id":"b4bd4e8be2ff6878",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"TENDER CIPHER = THE RED PRINCE\nUNCLE AWE = A NEW CLUE\nDRAFT THE SIXES = THE FIXED STARS\nLUNAR RENAMED = REALM AND RUNE\n\nASSUME THAT PAGE COUNT STARTS ON TITLE PAGES\n\nMAJOR KEY = MA JOR = Small Word?\n\nKEEP LEFT - Stay on the Left Page\n\nRED PAGE A WORD X = 4th Page - 1st Word = \nGREEN PAGE C WORD A = Page 6 -> 4th Word = \nVIOLET PAGE B WORD Y = Page 5 -> Word 2 = \nBLUE PAGE Z WORD X = Page 3 -> Word 1  = ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2760,
			"y":-384,
			"width":620,
			"height":404
		},
		{"id":"a2e950f207198e71","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_NwGKLFRNB7.png","x":4280,"y":652,"width":400,"height":268},
		{
			"id":"453bbf23e0163747",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"No tome after tome that the Library loaned.\nAnd the books that he had that he already owned.\nWere searched from their **covers** all the **way through**\nIf he found a new clue, he would know what to do.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3399,
			"y":-384,
			"width":496,
			"height":141
		},
		{
			"id":"7dd2ef752ae6c26f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# The Red Prince\n\nA Page - X Word\n\n\nCountless\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2409,
			"y":-820,
			"width":620,
			"height":340
		},
		{
			"id":"6bc247615803dc23",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Fixed Stars\n\nThird Page - First Word\n\nPreface The Florearis\nThis Rooms Green\nBook Are Rooms",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3060,
			"y":-820,
			"width":560,
			"height":340
		},
		{
			"id":"22ba5912bfee5073",
